<title>USA: N.Y. Thruway $350 mln bond deal restructured.</title>
<headline>N.Y. Thruway $350 mln bond deal restructured.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dillon, Read &amp; Co. said Wednesday it restructured New York State Thruway Authority's $350 million bond deal, adjusting the coupon in 2027 but leaving the yield unchanged at 5.57 percent.</p>
</text>
